# Osiris project pin, and the .bak a pin rewrite leaves behind. Untracked-and-
# unignored is the hazard: one `git add -A` publishes a seat's identity to a
# public remote. THIS repo's pin is benign (project = "osiris"), but the CLASS
# is not — other repos' pins carry seat handles. Fixable from the repo side in
# one line, needing no change to osiris itself (henry I, shellbiz dfc8a4c).
.osiris
.osiris.bak
